---
// 频道×标签组合着陆页（≥3 条才生成，票 08 门槛）：静态网格，零 JS
import Base from "../../../../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Sidebar from "../../../../../components/Sidebar.astro";
import CardV2 from "../../../../../components/CardV2.astro";
import { ui, LOCALES } from "../../../../../i18n";
import { items, itemsWithTag, categories, tagById, COMBO_MIN } from "../../../../../lib/data";

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return LOCALES.flatMap((locale) =>
    categories.flatMap((c: any) => {
      const catTagIds = [...new Set(items.filter((i: any) => i.category === c.slug).flatMap((i: any) => i.tags))];
      return catTagIds
        .filter((id) => itemsWithTag(id).length >= COMBO_MIN)
        .map((id) => ({ params: { locale, cat: c.slug, tag: id.split(":")[1] }, props: { cat: c, tagId: id } }));
    })
  );
}
const { locale } = Astro.params;
const cat = Astro.props.cat as any;
const tagId = Astro.props.tagId as string;
const tag = tagById.get(tagId);
const t = ui[locale as keyof typeof ui];
const list = itemsWithTag(tagId).filter((i: any) => i.category === cat.slug);
const title = locale === "zh" ? `${tag.name.zh} × ${cat.name.zh} · ${list.length} 个库 — uicurio` : `${tag.name.en} ${cat.name.en.toLowerCase()} – ${list.length} libraries · uicurio`;
const description = locale === "zh" ? `频道「${cat.name.zh}」中带「${tag.name.zh}」标签的 ${list.length} 个严选库。` : `${list.length} curated ${cat.name.en.toLowerCase()} tagged “${tag.name.en}”.`;
---
<Base locale={locale as any} title={title} description={description} ogImage={`/assets/shots/${list[0]?.screenshot}`}>
  <div class="shell">
    <Sidebar locale={locale} currentCat={cat.slug} showFacets={false} total={items.length} categories={categories.map((c: any) => ({ ...c, count: items.filter((i: any) => i.category === c.slug).length }))} />
    <main class="main">
      <nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href={`/${locale}/`}>uicurio</a>
        <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <a href={`/${locale}/collections/${cat.slug}/`}>{cat.name[locale]}</a>
        <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">{tag.name[locale]}</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:18px 0 4px">{tag.name[locale]} × {cat.name[locale]}</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--text-2)">{description}</p>
      <div class="grid">{list.map((i: any, idx: number) => <CardV2 item={i} locale={locale} index={idx} />)}</div>
      <footer class="foot"><span>{t.foot}</span><span>uicurio.shinji.me</span></footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</Base>
